{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And Elohim appeared.</b> After the mourning had passed." "<b>To Jacob again.</b> As He had appeared to him there when he went to Haran, as it says: <b>who appeared to you when you fled</b>." "<b>When he came from Paddan-aram.</b> But in Paddan-aram He did not appear to him, even though He spoke with him through an angel, as it says: וַיֹּאמֶר אֵלַי מַלְאַךְ הָאֱלֹהִים בַּחֲלוֹם (Genesis 31:11)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:20.774254462Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}